### Discovery-based load balancing (unit 5.5)
### Start the second instance: docker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.labs.yaml up --build -d
### Passwords come from .env.

@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Login
# @name userLogin
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo-user",
  "password": "<DEMO_USER_PASSWORD from .env>"
}

@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Send this several times, then compare the request count on catalog and catalog-2
### (metrics command in guidebooks/05-discovery-load-balancing.md). Expect an even split.
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
